      ..B..
     ...C...
    ....B....
   .ED.....DE.
  ..D{.....[D..
 .......A.......
.................
.BCB..A.1.A..BCB.
.................
 .......A.......
  ..D(.....<D..
   .ED.....DE.
    ....B....
     ...C...
      ..B..
       ...
ENDMAP
